\nhow\nmany\nsmall\nshapes goes into big shapes.\nCore\ncompetence:Critical\nThinking,\nProblem\nSolving,\nCommunication\nand\nCollaboration as they measure.\n5 minutes\nValues:Sharing, cooperation as they measure together.\nPcl:Taking turns as they share objects.\nStep 2\nLearners to identify how many small shapes go into\nbig shapes with the help of a teacher.\nCore\ncompetence:Critical\nThinking,\nProblem\nSolving,\nCommunication\nand\nCollaboration as they measure.\nValues:Sharing, cooperation as they measure together.\nPcl:Taking turns as they share objects.\nStep 3\nLearners to m", "ocrText": "", "imageOcrText": "", "imageCount": 0}
